<title>SWEDEN: ATHLETICS-KIPKETER EQUALS 800 METRES WORLD RECORD.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-KIPKETER EQUALS 800 METRES WORLD RECORD.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dane Wilson Kipketer equalled the men's 800 metres world record on Monday when he clocked one minute 41.73 seconds at the Stockholm Grand Prix.</p>
<p>Briton Seb Coe was first to set the time in Firenze, Italy on June 10, 1981.</p>
